<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pac Mags half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pac Mags half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    93.58 vs 87.60</p>
<p>    Net				     30.55 vs 31.38</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    10.40 vs 10.40</p>
<p>NOTE: Pacific Magazines and Printing Ltd is a magazine and commercial printing group and is about 45 percent owned by News Corporation.</p>
